    {
      "post_id": "524932935137628160",
      "text": "The gunman in Ottawa has been shot and killed. I'm at a loss for words this morning. That isn't my Canada.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 14:38:59 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524944658992865280",
      "text": "@HDMcC @kellyoxford @obiterdictayo CBC news is reporting the gunman has been shot. Are you bitching at them also?",
