      "parent_id": 5.249402231602872e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524962247563431936",
      "text": "@HDMcC @kellyoxford exactly, because they are \"journalists\" and \"dems the rules\" Kelly is a \"comedic writer\" no rules. Go police journalists",
